                <div class="content" role="main">



    <div class="confirmation-header confirmation-header--blank">
        <h1>Temporarily unavailable</h1>
        <p>Our waste service system is temporarily unavailable. This also affects our Contact Centre, as they are unable to access or update information at this time. Please refrain from calling until the system is restored. We apologise for any inconvenience and appreciate your patience. Please accept our apologies for the disruption and try again later.</p>
        
            <small>Code: 2aada4</small>
        
    </div>


